    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for all events in the engine. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All events derive from this class and must implement <ref refid="classEvent_1af14bbd8f69c2778def9462375a0e70f2" kindref="member">GetEventType()</ref>. The Handled flag can be used by event dispatchers to mark an event as processed.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Events are typically dispatched via <ref refid="classEventBus" kindref="compound">EventBus</ref> or <ref refid="classEventDispatcher" kindref="compound">EventDispatcher</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="EventType_8h_1a2628ea8d12e8b2563c32f05dc7fff6fa" kindref="member">EventType</ref>, <ref refid="classEventBus" kindref="compound">EventBus</ref>, <ref refid="classEventDispatcher" kindref="compound">EventDispatcher</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
